==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
{{term|lang=eo|ki-||interrogative and relative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix}} + {{term|lang=eo|-o||correlative suffix of objects}}

===Determiner===
{{eo-det}}

# [[what]] (the interrogative and relative correlative of objects)
# [[which]]
#: ''Mi daŭrigis mian laboron, ĝis kiam iu knabo aŭ virino diris "bagus, bagus," '''kio''' signifas "tre bela."''
#:: I continued my work, until some boy or woman said "bagus, bagus," which means "very pretty".

===Derived terms===
* {{l|eo|kio ajn|gloss=[[whatever]]}}

===Usage notes===
Like other correlatives of objects, and unlike English ''what'', ''[[kio]]'' always functions as a noun, never an adjective.

